93
00:06:33.393 --> 00:06:34.477
Well, hindi.

94
00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:36.437
Papunta ito kung saan tayo makakarating
ang pinakamalinaw na view

95
00:06:36.521 --> 00:06:38.272
