138
00:08:46.192 --> 00:08:48.778
Oh, okay lang ako. May mga gagawin ako.

139
00:08:48.861 --> 00:08:51.364
Gayunpaman, gayunpaman,
malamang hindi ka kumain ng tanghalian.

140
00:08:51.447 --> 00:08:54.408
Dapat mag-enjoy ka
tahimik na kainan kasama si Sop ngayon.

141
00:08:54.492 --> 00:08:55.535
See you later.

142
00:08:55.618 --> 00:08:57.954
- See you. paalam na!
- Magandang gabi, kung gayon.

143
00:08:58.037 --> 00:08:59.163
- Magandang gabi.
- Oo.

144
00:09:00.289 --> 00:09:01.123
paalam.

145
00:09:19.433 --> 00:09:20.685
sabi ko sayo.

146
00:09:21.269 --> 00:09:23.020
Inilalagay ko ang lahat ng <i>ramyeon </i>sa sulok.

147
00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:26.816
Sumama ka kay Sop.

148
00:09:27.316 --> 00:09:28.401
Gagawin ko.

149
00:09:58.097 --> 00:09:59.098
Dito.

150
00:10:00.516 --> 00:10:01.726
Teka.

151
